139533635 true] [17592186069190 1145 "First, we move the constant term to the right-hand side, the $-10z$ term to the left-hand side, and complete the square on the left-hand side.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{z}^{2}-50 & =-10z \\\\ {z}^{2}+10z & =50 \\\\ {z}^{2}+2\\cdot 5\\cdot z & =50 \\\\ {z}^{2}+2\\cdot 5\\cdot z+{5}^{2}-{5}^{2} & =50 \\\\ (z+5{)}^{2}-{5}^{2} & =50\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, we isolate the perfect square:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(z+5{)}^{2}-{5}^{2} & =50 \\\\ (z+5{)}^{2} & =75\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, $p=5,q=75,$ and $p+q=80.$\n\nNext, we solve the equation using the square-root method:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(z+5{)}^{2} & =75 \\\\ \\sqrt{(z+5{)}^{2}} & =\\sqrt{75} \\\\ |z+5| & =\\sqrt{75} \\\\ z+5 & =\\pm 5\\sqrt{3} \\\\ z & =-5\\pm 5\\sqrt{3}\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533635 true] [17592186243035 1017 #edb/ref 17592186243036 13194139533635 true] [17592186243035 1089 "q-112420" 13194139533635 true] [17592186243035 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045465 13194139533635 true] [17592186243035 1100 "The equation ${x}^{2}+6x+8=0$ can be written in the form $(x+p{)}^{2}=q.$ Find $\\,p+q,$ and solve the equation." 13194139533635 true] [17592186243035 1113 #uuid "e4526888-3995-5c7b-92cb-b5eeb975e983" 13194139533635 true] [17592186243035 1138 false 13194139533635 true] [17592186243035 1145 "First, we move the constant term to the right-hand side and complete the square on the left-hand side:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}^{2}+6x+8 & =0 \\\\ {x}^{2}+6x & =-8 \\\\ {x}^{2}+2\\cdot 3\\cdot x & =-8 \\\\ {x}^{2}+2\\cdot 3\\cdot x+{3}^{2}-{3}^{2} & =-8 \\\\ ({x}^{2}+2\\cdot 3\\cdot x+{3}^{2})-9 & =-8 \\\\ (x+3{)}^{2}-9 & =-8\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, we isolate the perfect square and solve the equation using the square-root method:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(x+3{)}^{2}-9 & =-8 \\\\ (x+3{)}^{2} & =1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, $p=3,q=1,$ and $p+q=4.$\n\nNext, we solve the equation using the square-root method:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(x+3{)}^{2} & =1 \\\\ \\sqrt{(x+3{)}^{2}} & =\\sqrt{1} \\\\ x+3 & =\\pm 1 \\\\ x & =-3\\pm 1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe simplify the two solutions:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x & =-3+1=-2 \\\\ x & =-3-1=-4\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the solutions are $x=-4$ and $x=-2.$" 13194139533635 true] [17592186243036 1000 #edb/ref 17592186243037 13194139533635 true] [17592186243036 1000 #edb/ref 17592186243038 13194139533635 true] [17592186243036 1000 #edb/ref 17592186243039 13194139533635 true] [17592186243036 1000 #edb/ref 17592186243040 13194139533635 true] [17592186243036 1000 #edb/ref 17592186243041 13194139533635 true] [17592186243036 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139533635 true] [17592186243036 1041 "selection" 13194139533635 true] [17592186243036 1104 #edb/ref 17592186243037 13194139533635 true] [17592186243036 1110 #uuid "6e0b20a5-737e-57da-8567-68d9f0fe9477" 13194139533635 true] [17592186243037 1034 "$p+q=4,\\,x=-4$ and $x=-2$" 13194139533635 true] [17592186243037 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139533635 true] [17592186243037 1111 #uuid "bfa0b688-6fce-58fc-988e-eb15d41877b0" 13194139533635 true] [17592186243038 1034 "$p+q=3,\\,x=-6$ and $x=1$" 13194139533635 true] [17592186243038 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139533635 true] [17592186243038 1111 #uuid "365947dc-402e-5a3f-b3ac-e6696b612205" 13194139533635 true] [17592186243039 1034 "$p+q=3,\\,x=-2$ and $x=5$" 13194139533635 true] [17592186243039 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139533635 true] [17592186243039 1111 #uuid "83b19c52-4989-58cf-831b-2b17b33d843d" 13194139533635 true] [17592186243040 1034 "$p+q=6,\\,x=-4$ and $x=-2$" 13194139533635 true] [17592186243040 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139533635 true] [17592186243040 1111 #uuid "56b3793d-ee9e-5827-815a-9edc79cf0013" 13194139533635 true] [17592186243041 1034 "$p+q=4,\\,x=-6$ and $x=1$" 13194139533635 true] [17592186243041 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139533635 true] [17592186243041 1111 #uuid "9749796f-d628-55cd-b5bb-9017fa3c375c" 13194139533635 true] [17592186243042 1017 #edb/ref 1759218624304