quation using the square-root method:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(x-10{)}^{2} & =121 \\\\ \\sqrt{(x-10{)}^{2}} & =\\sqrt{121} \\\\ x-10 & =\\pm 11 \\\\ x & =10\\pm 11\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe simplify the two solutions:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x & =10+11=21 \\\\ x & =10-11=-1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, the solutions are $x=-1$ and $x=21.$" 13194139533635 true] [17592186243113 1000 #edb/ref 17592186243114 13194139533635 true] [17592186243113 1000 #edb/ref 17592186243115 13194139533635 true] [17592186243113 1000 #edb/ref 17592186243116 13194139533635 true] [17592186243113 1000 #edb/ref 17592186243117 13194139533635 true] [17592186243113 1000 #edb/ref 17592186243118 13194139533635 true] [17592186243113 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139533635 true] [17592186243113 1041 "selection" 13194139533635 true] [17592186243113 1104 #edb/ref 17592186243118 13194139533635 true] [17592186243113 1110 #uuid "c3bdb649-16b7-5a07-a1c8-956d3595c6e8" 13194139533635 true] [17592186243114 1034 "$p+q=121,\\,x=-1$ and $x=21$" 13194139533635 true] [17592186243114 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139533635 true] [17592186243114 1111 #uuid "5c682bea-ffc0-513c-a21b-6624e9ee1f46" 13194139533635 true] [17592186243115 1034 "$p+q=100,\\,x=-11$ and $x=-1$" 13194139533635 true] [17592186243115 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139533635 true] [17592186243115 1111 #uuid "bba6d4c4-1382-535f-90b6-7e37feca6761" 13194139533635 true] [17592186243116 1034 "$p+q=111,\\,x=-11$ and $x=1$" 13194139533635 true] [17592186243116 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139533635 true] [17592186243116 1111 #uuid "62763fb4-d482-542b-b1c0-6f8a1af4465e" 13194139533635 true] [17592186243117 1034 "$p+q=101,\\,x=1$ and $x=11$" 13194139533635 true] [17592186243117 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139533635 true] [17592186243117 1111 #uuid "786349b6-d7e5-5c46-9efa-c46d3fee009e" 13194139533635 true] [17592186243118 1034 "$p+q=111,\\,x=-1$ and $x=21$" 13194139533635 true] [17592186243118 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139533635 true]